## 4. File Change Summary

| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `created()` | Initializes `sidebarCompact` from `isMobile` so the board sidebar starts collapsed on mobile. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `computed` | Adds `isMobile` (reads `$ui.isMobile`) and `sidebarOverlay` (`isMobile && !sidebarCompact`) helpers. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `watch` | Adds an `isMobile` watcher to auto-collapse/expand `sidebarCompact` when the mobile breakpoint is crossed. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `template` – board view wrapper | Adds `relative` and a fade-in scrim (`v-if="sidebarOverlay"`) that collapses the sidebar on tap. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `template` – `<KanbanBoardSidebar>` | Applies an `absolute inset-y-0 left-0 z-40 shadow-2xl` drawer class on mobile when expanded, so it floats over the canvas instead of squeezing it. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `<style scoped>` | Adds `.fade-*` transition classes for the mobile scrim. |

### Accessibility & UX Notes
- **Focus/keyboard:** The sidebar toggle and “browse boards” button remain focusable in compact mode; the drawer preserves the sidebar’s internal scroll observer (root = task list element) since it stays mounted.
- **Touch targets:** The compact rail toggle and browse button are `btn-sm`/`40px`; if you want to hard-guarantee 44px on mobile, we can bump the compact footer buttons to `btn-md` in a follow-up.
- **No color-only signaling:** The collapse/expand state is conveyed by the chevron icon direction plus the `title` attribute, not color alone.

Would you like me to also make the collapsed mobile rail full-height 44px touch targets, or hide the rail entirely on mobile in favor of a floating board button?

